; Synthetic survey read under *case toupper: cavern labels its stations
; FOO.P1, FOO.P2 and FOO.P3. The setting sits at the file's top level with no
; block around it, so it reaches whatever follows the *include. Nothing fixes
; it.
*case toupper
*begin foo
*data normal from to tape compass clino
p1 p2 10 90 0
p2 p3 10 0 0
*end foo
